    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are proud to present 26 Wilfield Park, an instantly striking and most appealing semi-detached residence to the open market. This fine family home is set in a peaceful, highly desirable cul-de-sac just minutes' stroll from the heart of Sandymount Village. No. 26 is a beautifully presented four-bedroom home offering spacious, thoughtfully designed living with an enviable blend of privacy, practicality, and style- making it ideal for a growing family looking for their forever home. The generously proportioned accommodation extends to approx. 165 sq mt/ 1,776 sq ft and comprises entrance hall, living room, dining room, TV room/study, garden room, kitchen/breakfast room, guest WC and upstairs there are four bedrooms and two bathrooms. \nThe property is positioned on a large plot, featuring a wonderful, landscaped garden to the front and rear. There is ample parking in a gravelled driveway which is bordered by a colourful array of mature shrubs and trees to the front and to the rear there is a private, sun-soaked rear garden, perfect for family life and entertaining. \nNestled along Dublin's shimmering coastline, Sandymount in Dublin?4 is a picturesque and charming seaside village that effortlessly blends natural beauty with heritage charm. Its heart is the serene Sandymount Strand, stretching nearly a kilometre along Dublin Bay and offering breathtaking promenades, sweeping views of Poolbeg Lighthouse, and dramatic sunsets—perfect for leisurely walks and birdwatching alike. \nThe village centre, anchored by the tranquil triangular Sandymount Green exudes a warm, village like atmosphere surrounded by elegant Georgian, Victorian, and Edwardian homes, independent cafés, boutiques, and gastropubs. Despite its tranquil seaside feel, Sandymount remains well-connected to the heart of Dublin via the DART (2 mins walk from the property) and multiple bus routes, offering the best of coastal calm and urban convenience. Dublin's finest junior and senior schools are literally on your doorstep to include: St Michael's, Muckross Park, Blackrock College, Loretto on the Green and St Andrew's to name but a few.\n\nViewing of this fine property comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nBright entrance hall with wooden floor, coving, wall panelling, cloak press and doors leading to…\n\nLiving Room - \nBeautiful living room with feature bay window overlooking the front garden with a white marble open fireplace, coving, centre rose, picture rail, wooden floor and pocket doors leading to…\n\nDining Room - \nGenerous room leading on from the living room with white marble open fireplace, coving, centre rose, picture rail, wooden floor and doors leading to…\n\nGarden Room - \nBright room overlooking the rear garden with coving, recessed lighting, floor tiles and double doors opening on to the patio\n\nKitchen/ Breakfast room - \nLarge room overlooking the rear garden. Kitchen with ample eye and base level cream wooden units with island and black stone countertop, integrated 5 ring gas hob, integrated oven, grill and microwave, integrated dishwasher, plumbed for washing machine and floor tiles\n\nTV Room/ Study - \nCosy room overlooking the front of the property with coving, recessed lighting, wooden floor and bespoke built-in desk and shelving unit\n\nInner Room - \nwith floor tiles and door to covered side passage\n\nGuest WC - \nwith WC, WHB, wall panelling and floor tiles\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - \nLarge double bedroom overlooking the front of the property with wall to wall and floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes, picture rail and carpet\n\nBedroom 2 - \nLarge double bedroom overlooking the rear garden with wall to wall and floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes, picture rail and carpet\n\nBedroom 3 - \nLarge single bedroom overlooking the rear garden with wall to wall and floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes and carpet\n\nBedroom 4 - \nLarge single bedroom overlooking the front of the property with carpet\n\nBathroom - \nwith WC, WHB with storage presses under, step-in electric shower, heated towel rail, wall and floor tiles\n\nBathroom - \nwith WHB with storage presses under, step-in shower, bath, wooden floor, recessed lighting and access to the attic\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Appealing and striking 4-bedroom family home in a peaceful cul-de-sac.</li><li> Located just minutes from Sandymount Village.</li><li> Presented in superb condition with a spacious, well-designed layout.</li><li> Landscaped front and rear gardens</li><li> Gravelled driveway with ample parking</li><li> Sun-soaked private rear garden, ideal for family living and entertaining</li><li> Close to fantastic public transport links including DART just 2 mins away</li><li> A short stroll to Sandymount Strand perfect for walks and sea views.</li><li> Close to Sandymount Green, surrounded by cafés, pubs, and boutiques</ul>"
      },
